  "details": "^ Title\never since the launch of the 2019 unity update for vrchat, i have been completely unable to use the gestures on my right hand (right shift + function keys)\nleft hand gestures remain completely fine. ive tested this on my own and on other peoples avatars and found the same problem. i have no issues in vr, nor do i have any issues on my different computer. i dont think ive been able to find anyone else who has this issue. \ni dont recall encountering this issue on the beta. ive also tried contacting support, and tried their solutions, such as clearing cache and verifying files, ive even tried a reinstall, and neither has worked.\ni would post my output logs just incase it helps, however i cant post zips or text files here :/",
